e a mattress cover: If you have an infestation, consider using a mattress cover to keep bed bugs from coming into your home. These covers can be purchased at most hardware stores and can be a great way to protect your mattress and other furniture from bed bugs.\n\n8. Call a professional: If you\u2019re struggling to get rid of bed bugs on your own, it may be time to call a professional. A professional can help you identify the source of the infestation, as well as provide you with effective treatment options.",
